# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# tinywin package set — deliberately short. If it isn't here, it isn't shipped.
# Rule: a package has to (a) make the hardware work, (b) be part of the desktop
# you see, or (c) let you install something else without a terminal.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

